# At 1 MHz with AC drive 1 V and a 1-ohm sensor, V_sense = 2*pi*f*C.
# Targets are volts; for example N_CISS 520 pF -> 3.267256 mV.
# Datasheet capacitances are typical only: deviations give WARN.
N_CISS  warn_rel  0.25  3.26725636m
P_CISS  warn_rel  0.25  2.76460154m
N_COSS  warn_rel  0.25  1.13097336m
P_COSS  warn_rel  0.25  1.25663706m
N_CRSS  warn_rel  0.30  452.389342u
P_CRSS  warn_rel  0.30  584.336233u
